# 박물관 직원: proud of her museum, goes stiff and formal (-습니다) when she's nervous. (format: js/core/villagers.js)

=== person staff
at morning museum 60 78
at afternoon museum 60 78
at evening sikdang 30 70
at evening sikdang 30 70
at evening gang 40 70
greet st_hi
chat 0 st_quiet
chat 0 st_masks
chat 0 st_dinner
ask 탈 st_ask_mask
ask 할머니 st_ask_gm
bye st_bye
bye st_bye2
bye st_bye3

=== scene st_hi
staff[happy]: {안녕하세요}! {어서 오세요}.
(She straightens a stack of leaflets that was already straight.)

=== scene st_quiet
staff: {오늘}{은|은/는}... {사람}{이|이/가} {없어요}.
(She looks around the empty hall and sighs.)
* {괜찮아요}. {저}{는|은/는} {여기} {있어요}. -> st_quiet_a
* {이상해요}. -> st_quiet_b

=== scene st_quiet_a
staff[happy]: 하하. {네}! {고마워요}.
(For a moment she forgets to be formal.)
! rel staff +1

=== scene st_quiet_b
staff[worried]: {네}... {이상해요}.
(She glances at the glass case and quickly looks away.)

=== scene st_masks
staff: {이거}{는|은/는} {옛날} {탈}{입니다}.
(She waves at a row of masks along the wall, very proudly.)
* {예뻐요}! -> st_masks_a
* {진짜}{예요|이에요}? -> st_masks_b

=== scene st_masks_a
staff[happy]: {네}! {예뻐요}!
(She beams, as if you'd said it about her own children.)
! rel staff +1

=== scene st_masks_b
staff[worried]: {진짜}... {입니다}. {진짜}{입니다}.
(She says it a little too quickly.)

=== scene st_dinner
staff: {저녁}{에}{는|은/는}... {식당}{에서} {먹어요}.
(She has a book open next to her bowl. Alone, every evening, by the look of it.)
* {같이} {먹어요}! -> st_dinner_a
* {맛있어요}? -> st_dinner_b

=== scene st_dinner_a
staff[surprised]: {같이}{요}? ...{네}! {좋아요}.
(She moves her book to make room.)
! rel staff +2

=== scene st_dinner_b
staff[happy]: {네}. {김밥}{이|이/가} {맛있어요}.
(She lifts a piece with her chopsticks to show you.)

=== scene st_ask_mask
staff[worried]: {탈}... {탈}{은|은/는}...
(She looks at the glass case, then at the door, and lowers her voice.)
staff: {서울} {선생님}{은|은/는}... {안} {왔어요}. {오늘}{도}.
(She says it like it's good news. Then she changes the subject.)

=== scene st_ask_gm
staff[sad]: 김순자 {선생님}... {좋은} {선생님}{입니다}.
(She means it. There's a small photo of the two of them pinned behind the desk.)
! rel staff +1

=== scene st_bye
staff: {네}. {안녕히 가세요}.
(She goes back to her leaflets.)

=== scene st_bye2
staff[happy]: {내일} {만나요}.
(A small, polite bow.)

=== scene st_bye3
staff: {오늘} {날씨}{가|이/가} {좋아요}.
(She says it the way you'd say it to a visitor: polite, and finished.)
